    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41812" root="وذح" body-key="w">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَذِحَتِ الشَّاتُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْذَحُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَيْذَحُ</span> (S, K)
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِيذَح</span>, (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَذَحٌ</span>, (S,) <i>The sheep was,</i>
or <i>became, foul with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَذَح</span> [q. v. infrà.] (S, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَذِحَ</span>, inf. n. as above, <i>He suffered from an
inflammation and excoriation of the inner sides
of his thighs;</i> (En-Nadr, L, K; *) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَذِحَ</span>.
(En-Nadr, L.)

